WEBVTT

00:10.341 --> 00:14.789
And now with an editorial,
here's Squidward Tentacles.
现在有了一篇社论，
这是章鱼哥的触手。

00:14.789 --> 00:16.409
Good evening.
晚上好。

00:16.409 --> 00:19.168
Everyone continues
to be horrible,
大家继续
变得可怕，

00:19.168 --> 00:20.823
and I've got the proof.
我有证据。

00:20.823 --> 00:23.306
Here are my
"Beefs of the week."
这是我的
“本周精选牛肉。”

00:23.306 --> 00:26.789
Our first beef is,
我们的第一块牛肉是，

00:26.789 --> 00:30.892
this filthy foodie always eats
before he pays.
这个肮脏的美食家总是吃东西
在他付款之前。

00:32.065 --> 00:34.065
Then he gives me a handful
of money
然后他给了我一把
钱的

00:34.065 --> 00:37.858
slathered in slimy grease.
涂满了粘稠的油脂。

00:44.134 --> 00:46.168
Horrible. Next.
可怕。下一个。

00:46.168 --> 00:49.858
Ho-Ho, boy, do I have a beef
with this annoying guy.
嗬嗬，孩子，我有牛肉吗
和这个烦人的家伙。

00:51.203 --> 00:52.478
What?
什么？

00:52.478 --> 00:54.513
I'm done?
我受够了？

00:54.513 --> 00:57.616
But I've got 47 more "beefs."
但我还有 47 块“牛肉”。

00:57.616 --> 00:59.858
Typical.
典型的。

00:59.858 --> 01:04.237
Coming up next,
it's "Fun-believable" with...
接下来，
这是“有趣且可信”的……

01:04.237 --> 01:05.651
Rube Goldfish?
鲁布金鱼？

01:05.651 --> 01:07.685
Huh?
啊？

01:07.685 --> 01:08.996
Oh, no.
哦，不。

01:08.996 --> 01:11.720
That guy puts mustard
in his milkshakes.
那家伙放了芥末
在他的奶昔里。

01:11.720 --> 01:13.996
Horrible.
可怕。

01:13.996 --> 01:17.203
Whoa, whoa, hey, watch it.
哇哇哇，嘿嘿，看一下。

01:17.203 --> 01:18.927
Well, hello, everybody.
嗯，大家好。

01:18.927 --> 01:21.961
I'm Rube Goldfish,
and today we'll be exploring
我是鲁布金鱼
今天我们将探索

01:21.961 --> 01:26.203
the amazing and unknown
Bikini Bottom.
令人惊奇和未知的
比基尼下装。

01:29.927 --> 01:32.030
<i>what you are about to see</i>
<i>您将要看到的内容</i>

01:32.030 --> 01:37.582
<i>is gonna make you say,
"That's Fun-believable."</i>
<i>会让你说，
“这很有趣，令人难以置信。”</i>

01:41.272 --> 01:42.685
Uhh...
呃...

01:42.685 --> 01:45.513
we're here at
Sandy Cheeks' Treedome,
我们现在在
桑迪奇克斯的树顶，

01:45.513 --> 01:48.927
because--
- Um, excuse us, Rube, but...
因为——
- 嗯，对不起，鲁布，但是……

01:48.927 --> 01:51.892
The public restroom is
right around the corner, boys.
公共卫生间是
就在拐角处，孩子们。

01:51.892 --> 01:54.720
No, Patrick and I
have something to show you.
不，帕特里克和我
有东西要给你看。

01:54.720 --> 01:57.030
It's "Fun-believable."
这是“有趣且可信”。

01:58.065 --> 01:59.409
Really?
真的吗？

01:59.409 --> 02:01.341
Well, that's just what
I'm looking for.
嗯，就是这样
我正在寻找。

02:01.341 --> 02:03.099
Show us what you got.
向我们展示您得到了什么。

02:06.134 --> 02:07.409
Okay, you ready?
好吧，你准备好了吗？

02:07.409 --> 02:08.927
- I think so.
- This is our chance.
- 我想是的。
- 这是我们的机会。

02:08.927 --> 02:10.409
Oh, you don't have to tell me, SpongeBob.
噢，你不必告诉我，海绵宝宝。

02:10.409 --> 02:11.720
All right. All right.
All right.
好的。好的。
好的。

02:11.720 --> 02:13.099
- Is he still there?
- Let's check.
- 他还在吗？
- 让我们检查一下。

02:13.099 --> 02:14.720
- Okay, he's still there.
- You ready?
- 好吧，他还在那儿。
- 你准备好了吗？

02:14.720 --> 02:17.996
Yeah.
both: One, two...
是的。
两者：一、二……

02:17.996 --> 02:20.065
We're ready!
我们准备好了！

02:20.065 --> 02:21.961
We're not ready.
我们还没准备好。

02:21.961 --> 02:25.065
Okay, come back when you are.
好吧，有空就回来吧。

02:25.065 --> 02:26.892
Must be camera shy.
一定是害羞相机。

02:26.892 --> 02:27.996
Yipe!
哎呀！

02:27.996 --> 02:31.651
Would you look at that?
Amazing.
你会看一下吗？
惊人的。

02:35.547 --> 02:36.616
Whoa!
哇！

02:39.547 --> 02:41.720
Howdy do, Rube?
你好，鲁布？

02:41.720 --> 02:43.306
Howdy, Miss Cheeks.
你好，奇克斯小姐。

02:43.306 --> 02:47.306
Now, if the robotic arms weren't
"Fun-believable" enough,
现在，如果没有机械臂
足够“有趣-可信”，

02:47.306 --> 02:50.513
I understand that you have
a secret skill
我明白你有
一项秘密技能

02:50.513 --> 02:52.272
that nobody knows about.
没人知道。

02:52.272 --> 02:53.754
That's right, Rube.
没错，鲁布。

02:53.754 --> 02:56.582
I hold the squirrel record
for the most nuts
我保持松鼠记录
对于大多数坚果来说

02:56.582 --> 02:58.409
stored in my cheeks.
储存在我的脸颊上。

02:58.409 --> 03:01.478
Wow. Can you give us
a demonstration?
哇。你能给我们吗
示威？

03:01.478 --> 03:03.547
Sure can.
I just happened to have
当然可以。
我只是碰巧有

03:03.547 --> 03:05.272
some hazelnuts handy.
一些方便的榛子。

03:08.892 --> 03:10.513
Ooh.
哦。

03:10.513 --> 03:13.065
Ahh-ahh!
啊啊啊！

03:13.065 --> 03:14.961
Wow, impressive.
哇，令人印象深刻。

03:14.961 --> 03:17.961
I don't think it's possible
to fit any more than that.
我认为这是不可能的
适合更多的东西。

03:17.961 --> 03:21.789
You ain't seen nuttin' yet.
你还没见过疯子。

03:23.306 --> 03:27.203
Ahh-ahh-ahhh-ahhh.
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊。

03:28.651 --> 03:30.341
Wow.
哇。

03:30.341 --> 03:32.823
Fun-believable.
有趣可信。

03:32.823 --> 03:34.927
both: Oh, Rube?
两人：哦，鲁布？

03:34.927 --> 03:37.237
We're ready.
We're ready. We're ready.
我们准备好了。
我们准备好了。我们准备好了。

03:37.237 --> 03:40.306
Well, folks, it looks like--
both: We're ready. We're ready.
好吧，伙计们，看起来就像——
两人：我们准备好了。我们准备好了。

03:40.306 --> 03:42.306
Ahh-ahh!
啊啊啊！

03:46.134 --> 03:47.582
Ugh.
啊。

03:47.582 --> 03:50.375
I think I have a nut-ache.
我想我有点头痛。

03:50.375 --> 03:52.203
both: Sorry, Sandy.
两人：对不起，桑迪。

03:52.203 --> 03:55.754
Hey, Rube,
should we come back later?
嘿，鲁布，
我们应该稍后再回来吗？

03:55.754 --> 03:59.168
Yeah, later would be good.
是啊，以后就好了。

04:02.823 --> 04:05.720
We're here
at Nosferatu's Castle.
我们在这里
在诺斯费拉图城堡。

04:05.720 --> 04:08.651
Which is a Historical landmark
in Bikini Bottom, by the way.
这是一个历史地标
顺便说一句，在比基尼底部。

04:08.651 --> 04:10.927
Well, thanks, Rube.
好吧，谢谢，鲁布。

04:10.927 --> 04:14.341
But why are we here today,
Mr. Nosferatu?
但我们今天为何来到这里，
诺斯费拉图先生？

04:14.341 --> 04:15.961
Could you give us a hint?
你能给我们一个提示吗？

04:17.203 --> 04:18.892
The master wants to
show you his--
主人想要
给你看他的——

04:18.892 --> 04:21.272
heh-heh-heh--
pain-reaction--
嘿嘿嘿——
疼痛反应--

04:21.272 --> 04:24.547
oh,
I mean chain-reaction machine.
哦，
我的意思是链式反应机。

04:26.444 --> 04:28.099
Ugh!
啊!

04:33.478 --> 04:37.513
So how does this
crazy contraption work, anyway?
那么这是如何做到的
无论如何，疯狂的装置工作？

04:37.513 --> 04:42.513
Okay, Master, let it roll.
好吧，主人，就让它滚吧。

04:44.616 --> 04:45.996
Oh. Oh, my. Ha-ha-ha.
哦。哦，我的。哈哈哈。

04:45.996 --> 04:46.996
Ohh.
哦。

05:01.513 --> 05:03.513
Heh-heh-heh. Wow.
呵呵。哇。

05:05.582 --> 05:06.582
Ha-ha-ha-ha.
哈哈哈。

05:11.823 --> 05:14.616
Mmm, snackies.
嗯，零食。

05:16.789 --> 05:19.341
Ugh! Hee-hee-hee.
啊!嘻嘻嘻。

05:24.720 --> 05:26.892
The master says,
大师说，

05:26.892 --> 05:30.754
Rube's show is brought to you
by Fizzy Fangs Soda.
Rube的表演给你带来了
碳酸毒牙苏打水。

05:30.754 --> 05:33.858
It tickles my teeth,
Heh-Heh-Heh.
看得我牙齿痒痒的
呵呵。

05:33.858 --> 05:39.616
Fellas, that was truly
Fun-believable.
伙计们，这确实是
有趣可信。

05:41.547 --> 05:44.685
both:
We're ready for you, Rube
两者：
我们已经为你准备好了，鲁布

05:44.685 --> 05:47.961
Are you sure?
你确定吗？

05:49.582 --> 05:50.823
both: No.
两人：没有。

05:52.306 --> 05:56.444
I guess their moment
has passed... away.
我猜他们的时刻
已经过去了。

05:58.203 --> 06:00.478
Whoo!
呼！

06:00.478 --> 06:02.927
We're here with "Baby Prunes."
我们带着“小西梅”来了。

06:02.927 --> 06:05.685
Now, you're the oldest resident
of Bikini Bottom.
现在，你是最年长的居民
的比基尼底部。

06:05.685 --> 06:06.685
Isn't that right?
是不是这样？

06:06.685 --> 06:08.823
What are you, a cop?
你是什​​么人，警察？

06:08.823 --> 06:10.789
Ma, behave.
妈，乖点吧。

06:10.789 --> 06:13.961
He's interviewing me, Mary,
so shut up.
他正在采访我，玛丽，
所以闭嘴。

06:13.961 --> 06:16.203
You are too much.
你太过分了。

06:16.203 --> 06:19.341
Honey, you should have seen me
70 years ago
亲爱的，你应该看看我
70年前

06:19.341 --> 06:22.685
when I was middle-aged
and wild.
当我人到中年的时候
和野生的。

06:27.513 --> 06:29.203
You're putting me on.
你这是在给我装逼

06:29.203 --> 06:35.685
How could a sweet little old
lady like you ever be wild?
怎么可能是一个可爱的小老头
女士像你一样狂野吗？

06:35.685 --> 06:38.927
That sounds like a challenge.
这听起来像是一个挑战。

06:40.892 --> 06:42.720
Holy helicopters.
神圣的直升机。

06:42.720 --> 06:44.858
We are flying over
Bikini Bottom,
我们飞过
比基尼下装，

06:44.858 --> 06:49.272
and the view is spectacular.
景色非常壮观。

06:49.272 --> 06:50.616
Hello.
你好。

06:50.616 --> 06:52.478
Hi, Rube.
嗨，鲁布。

06:52.478 --> 06:55.616
Baby Prunes, I've never seen
someone your age
梅子宝宝，我没见过
与你同龄的人

06:55.616 --> 06:58.030
so amazingly active.
如此活跃。

06:58.030 --> 07:01.789
You call this active?
I'll show you active.
你管这叫主动？
我会向你展示活跃的。

07:01.789 --> 07:04.030
Ah-ha!
- Whoa-oh-oh!
啊哈！
- 哇哦哦！

07:06.203 --> 07:10.099
Mrs. Prunes, you don't have to
go this fast to impress me.
普鲁内斯女士，你不必
走这么快是为了给我留下深刻印象。

07:10.099 --> 07:12.651
This is your captain speaking.
这是你们的队长在讲话。

07:12.651 --> 07:13.961
We're going down again.
我们又要下去了。

07:13.961 --> 07:15.651
Eh... ohh!
呃……哦！

07:15.651 --> 07:17.754
Whoa-oh-oh-oh!
哇哦哦哦！

07:17.754 --> 07:19.065
Whoa!
哇！

07:19.065 --> 07:22.720
Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh,
ahhh!
哦-哦-哦-哦-哦，
啊啊！

07:22.720 --> 07:27.892
Uh, that was the furthest thing
from Fun-believable.
呃，那是最远的事情
来自有趣可信。

07:27.892 --> 07:30.375
You could have fooled me.
你本来可以愚弄我的。

07:31.858 --> 07:35.237
Huh? Flapping Yaps at 12:00
啊？ 12:00 拍打雅普

07:37.823 --> 07:40.375
Whoa-oh!
哇哦！

07:40.375 --> 07:41.961
Ha-ha! Huh?
哈哈！啊？

07:41.961 --> 07:45.099
This thousand-boat pileup
might be the greatest tragedy
这千船连环相撞
可能是最大的悲剧

07:45.099 --> 07:47.444
to ever befall Bikini Bottom.
永远降临比基尼底部。

07:47.444 --> 07:50.203
And I just want to thank
my Great Gram-Gram
我只想感谢
我伟大的格拉姆

07:50.203 --> 07:52.306
for flying the copter today.
今天驾驶直升机。

07:52.306 --> 07:58.685
She is the oldest citizen
in Bikini Bottom at 115.
她是最年长的公民
比基尼泳裤 115。

07:58.685 --> 08:00.134
Mwah!
哇！

08:02.409 --> 08:05.513
You are not the oldest citizen
in Bikini Bottom.
你不是最年长的公民
在比基尼底部。

08:05.513 --> 08:09.478
You're only 115.
I'm 116.
你才115岁。
我116岁了。

08:09.478 --> 08:11.237
Ooh, you fibber.
哦，你个胡言乱语。

08:11.237 --> 08:15.789
If I wasn't your elder,
I'd pop you right in the beezer.
如果我不是你的长辈
我会把你直接扔进beezer。

08:15.789 --> 08:19.341
I'm the oldest.
我是最年长的。

08:21.685 --> 08:24.030
Oh-oh-oh-oh!
哦-哦-哦-哦！

08:24.030 --> 08:26.789
I challenge you
to a copter duel.
我向你挑战
直升机决斗。

08:26.789 --> 08:30.892
Oh, it's on,
like my hearing aid.
哦，已经开启了，
就像我的助听器一样。

08:32.030 --> 08:34.099
Copter duel?.
直升机决斗？

08:34.099 --> 08:35.927
No!
不！

08:39.789 --> 08:41.996
This just in.
这个刚进去

08:41.996 --> 08:44.237
TV news anchor Perch Perkins
电视新闻主播珀奇·帕金斯

08:44.237 --> 08:48.444
jumped out
of a helicopter today.
跳出来
今天的直升机。

08:48.444 --> 08:50.203
Whoa!
哇！

08:53.720 --> 08:56.030
This is a no-fly zone, sister.
这是禁飞区，姐姐。

08:56.030 --> 08:58.616
Whoa-oh-oh!
哇哦哦！

08:58.616 --> 09:01.513
Hey, you. Get off of my cloud.
嘿，你。离开我的云端。

09:01.513 --> 09:06.341
I'm the oldest.
我是最年长的。

09:06.341 --> 09:08.341
I'll have to change the name
of this show
我得改个名字
这个节目的

09:08.341 --> 09:13.547
from "FUN-believable" to...
ahhh!
从“有趣可信”到...
啊啊！

09:15.237 --> 09:17.306
Ohh!
哦！

09:17.306 --> 09:18.375
Oh-oh-oh-oh!
哦-哦-哦-哦！

09:19.996 --> 09:21.375
Whee!
哎哟！

09:28.823 --> 09:31.582
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha!
啊哈哈哈哈！

09:31.582 --> 09:34.134
Time to go home, you two.
你们两个该回家了。

09:34.134 --> 09:37.168
Yeah, that's enough excitement
for today.
是啊，够兴奋了
今天。

09:37.168 --> 09:39.823
Aww.
哇。

09:44.720 --> 09:47.513
I'm the oldest.
我是最年长的。

09:47.513 --> 09:48.996
I am the oldest.
我是最年长的。

09:48.996 --> 09:52.409
I'm the oldest.
我是最年长的。

09:52.409 --> 09:55.961
Huh, I guess she was
the oldest.
呵呵，我猜她是
最古老的。

09:55.961 --> 09:58.685
But I'm the oldest now.
但我现在是最年长的了。

10:00.444 --> 10:04.375
Well, we've come to end
of our show, everybody,
好吧，我们已经结束了
我们的节目，大家，

10:04.375 --> 10:07.823
and I just want to tell ya
how Fun-be--
我只想告诉你
多么有趣——

10:07.823 --> 10:10.099
We're ready, Rube.
我们准备好了，鲁布。

10:10.099 --> 10:11.961
It's now or never, fellas.
要么现在，要么永远，伙计们。

10:11.961 --> 10:12.961
Take it away.
把它拿走。

10:12.961 --> 10:14.513
Ahh.
啊。

10:14.513 --> 10:15.720
Ahh!
啊！

10:15.720 --> 10:16.996
Doink!
多因克！

10:27.306 --> 10:29.099
Wow.
哇。

10:33.823 --> 10:35.892
Whoa.
哇哦。

10:35.892 --> 10:37.306
both: Ta-da!
两人：哒哒！

10:37.306 --> 10:42.513
Ooh-hoo!
Now, that's Fun-believable.
哦呼！
现在，这很有趣-可信。

10:43.685 --> 10:45.513
Horrible.
可怕。

10:45.513 --> 10:46.582
Click.
点击。

点击。